      },
      "description": "French company written with its legal form first, \"SAS BLENET-CHUL\", \"Selarl Amandine Riquelme\" (Docudis addition)",
      "examples": [
        "SAS BLENET-CHUL",
        "SCI STONE",
        "Selarl Amandine Riquelme"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "regex:fr:labeled_company",
      "entityType": "COMPANY",
      "pattern": "(?<=(?:Dénomination|Raison sociale|Nom commercial|Enseigne|Sigle|Employeur)[ \\u00A0]?:[ \\u00A0]?)\\p{Lu}[^\\n,;:]{1,79}?(?=[ \\u00A0]*(?:[,;\\n]|$))",
      "flags": "gmu",
      "confidence": 0.8,
      "domains": [
        "legal"
      ],
      "classification": {
        "category": "organization",
        "subtype": "company",
        "applicability": "baseline",
        "verticals": [
          "legal"
        ],
        "protectionLevel": "recommended",
        "defaultAction": "hide",
        "provenance": "docudis",
        "status": "active"
      },
      "description": "Company name after a form label such as \"Dénomination :\" or \"Employeur :\" (Docudis addition). The value must start with a capital, so \"à compléter\" is not a name.",
      "examples": [
        "Sigle : MECADISTRIB",
        "Employeur : Menuiserie Berthelot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "regex:fr:company_head",
      "entityType": "COMPANY",
      "pattern": "(?<![\\p{L}])(?:Cabinet|Mutuelle|Clinique|Agence|Banque|Pharmacie|Garage|Boulangerie|Restaurant|Hôtel|Étude|Groupe|Établissements|Ets|Transports|Menuiserie|Atelier|Maison de santé|Maison|Hôpital|Hopital|Centre hospitalier|Laboratoire|Lycée|Collège|Université|CABINET|MUTUELLE|CLINIQUE|AGENCE|BANQUE|PHARMACIE|GARAGE|BOULANGERIE|RESTAURANT|HOTEL|HÔTEL|GROUPE|HÔPITAL|LABORATOIRE)(?:[ \\u00A0](?:(?:de|du|des|la|le|les|et|en|&|d'|l')[ \\u00A0]?)*(?:\\p{Lu}[\\p{L}\\d.'’&-]*|\\d+[\\p{L}\\d]*|santé)){1,5}",
      "flags": "gu",
      "confidence": 0.8,
      "domains": [
        "general"
      ],
      "classification": {
        "category": "organization",
        "subtype": "company",
        "applicability": "baseline",
        "verticals": [],
        "protectionLevel": "recommended",
        "defaultAction": "hide",
        "provenance": "docudis",
        "status": "active"
      },
      "description": "French business name that starts with a trade noun, \"Cabinet Vasseur & Associés\", \"RESTAURANT LE MARTINET\" (Docudis addition). At least one capitalised word must follow, so \"la clinique\" in prose is not a name. (Docudis change 2026-09-21: added hospitals, labs and schools, and \"Maison de santé\", whose second word is lower case and so could never match the capitalised continuation, and a number may finish the name (\"Université Lumière Lyon 2\"), which the per-region company rules already allowed and this one did not.)",
      "examples": [
        "Cabinet Vasseur & Associés",
        "Mutuelle Horizon Santé",
        "RESTAURANT LE MARTINET"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "regex:fr:rcs",
      "entityType": "SSN",
      "pattern": "\\bRCS[ \\u00A0]\\p{L}[\\p{L} '’-]{1,40}?[ \\u00A0](?:[AB][ \\u00A0])?\\d{3}[ \\u00A0]?\\d{3}[ \\u00A0]?\\d{3}\\b",
